ile-height=\"24\" />4.8<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一副普通的眼镜，手工打磨，缺乏特点，任何一家眼镜店都不会缺乏的款式。但无论如何，它的意义并不会因此而受损，“一扇用于观察外界的小窗户”。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302308.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/3e/Belonging-302308.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">手工编织流苏披肩<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Handwoven Tassel Shawl</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条设计简约的流苏披肩，购置于某街角的一家无名服装店。<br />外派任务的时间总是短促而珍贵，好在我们的受访者总能提前而妥帖地完成它们。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302309.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/05/Belonging-302309.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">斜口笔架蘸水钢笔<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Exquisite Oblique Pen Set</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />12<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>波彭“实用主义”系列斜口笔架，搭配固定款蘸水笔头，书写体验相当优秀。展示它时，受访者显得相当慎重。“我从来都不知道，连钢笔都有如此之多的风格……”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A51.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 重叠的词句1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A51.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A51.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A51.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A51.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A51.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A51.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A52.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 重叠的词句2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A52.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A52.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A52.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8D%E5%8F%A0%E7%9A%84%E8%AF%8D%E5%8F%A52.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijis